description Avatar 59 fps base with frame generation x2, declared -src 60, -subgen armed, b:flip present, -lock -lag 75 -dejit. One benchmark test, no fade at either end. Substitution has nothing to substitute: the change map refuses 99.6 percent of retracted members as duplicates of the real frame they were paired with.
